<Base title="About" description="About AI Tools Weekly — the free weekly digest of the best AI tools for small business owners.">
  <h1>About AI Tools Weekly</h1>

  <p>AI Tools Weekly is a free weekly newsletter that cuts through the noise to bring you the most useful AI tools for running a small business. Every Monday morning, we send one focused email: three hand-picked tools, a quick tip, and nothing else.</p>

  <p>We track hundreds of product launches, review them for real business value, and only feature tools that can genuinely save you time or make you more money. No hype, no fluff — just practical picks you can start using this week.</p>

  <h2>Who is this for?</h2>
  <p>Small business owners, freelancers, consultants, and solopreneurs who want to stay ahead of the AI curve without spending hours reading tech news.</p>

  <h2>How does it work?</h2>
  <p>Every Monday, our automated system scans the latest AI tool launches, surfaces the most business-relevant picks, and writes a concise summary. We keep the format tight so you can read it in under 3 minutes — and actually act on what you learn.</p>

  <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
  <p>Some links in the newsletter and on this site are affiliate links. When you click a link and sign up for a tool, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This is how we keep the newsletter free. We only recommend tools we'd genuinely use ourselves.</p>

